WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Every car begins with a job. Define what it must do before drawing hardware.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Fast, cheap, and safe are wishes until each becomes a measurable question.

3
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:55.000
A useful target states a quantity, unit, condition, and verification method. The 1,200 kg target is illustrative.

4
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Make each requirement testable. NASA’s systems engineering handbook informs the method, not vehicle law.
